    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Imagine that every time you fall asleep, a new adventure awaits you...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episode 2 is the sequel to the popular Adventurer game, where the main protagonist dives into a new adventure whenever he goes to sleep. Will he be able to wake up, or will he remain trapped in the dream? It\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D maps and battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of camera angles and perspectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Episodic story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement: Arrow keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate: Q, E</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zoom in/out: C, V</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera angle: R, F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change camera: B</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory: X</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action/Use: ENTER</p></li></ul>",
